| prevalent | adj. | 流行的，普遍的 | widespread, pervasive | rare, uncommon |
| probity | n. | 正直，诚实 | integrity, honesty | dishonesty, corruption |
| profligate | adj. | 挥霍的，放荡的 | wasteful, extravagant | frugal, thrifty |
| propitiate | v. | 讨好，安抚 | appease, conciliate | antagonize, provoke |
| prosaic | adj. | 乏味的，平淡的 | mundane, dull | exciting, imaginative |
| prudent | adj. | 谨慎的，明智的 | cautious, judicious | reckless, imprudent |
| pundit | n. | 权威，专家 | expert, authority | novice, amateur |

